        "ISO27001" => "ISO 27001 certified infrastructure is available in all regions. An information security management system (ISMS) policy must be acknowledged by the tenant admin.",
        "FedRAMP"  => "FedRAMP authorization is only available in US East and US West regions. Additional security controls, continuous monitoring, and a System Security Plan (SSP) are required.",
